msgstr "自動機銃を作動せよ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_006"
msgid "Release hostages\n"
msgstr "人質を助けろ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_007"
msgid "Retrieve experimental weapon\n"
msgstr "実験中のウェポンを回収せよ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_008"
msgid "Destroy sensitive information\n"
msgstr "重要機密を処分せよ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_009"
msgid "Deactivate bomb\n"
msgstr "爆発を防げ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_010"
msgid "Obtain sensitive info.\n"
msgstr "Obtain sensitive info.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_011"
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Guard's\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_012"
msgid "Sensitive info\n"
msgstr "重要機密\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_013"
msgid "Sensitive info\n"
msgstr "重要機密\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_014"
msgid "Picked up sensitive info.\n"
msgstr "重要機密を手に入れた\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_015"
msgid "Automatic gun activated.\n"
msgstr "自動機銃を作動\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_016"
msgid "Too many hostages killed.\n"
msgstr "人質の被害が多すぎます\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_017"
msgid "Hostages have been saved.\n"
msgstr "人質の救出完了\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_018"
msgid "Sensitive information has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "重要機密の処分完了\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_019"
msgid "Carrington has been killed.\n"
msgstr "キャリントンが倒された\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_020"
msgid "Joanna - we're under attack.\n"
msgstr "ジョアンナ！　格納庫が攻撃を受けている！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_021"
msgid "Get the guns back on line - hurry.\n"
msgstr "自動機銃システムを再起動するんだ、急げ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_022"
msgid "The Skedar have taken hostages.\n"
msgstr "スケダーがスタッフを人質に取ったぞ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_023"
msgid "Get up to the offices and save them.\n"
msgstr "オフィスに戻り彼らを助けてくれ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_024"
msgid "They're using a new form of shield technology.\n"
msgstr ""
"ヤツらは新しいシールド技術を\n"
"使っているようだ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_025"
msgid ""
"Foster was working on a new weapon which may \n"
"be useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"フォスターが試作している新しい武器が\n"
"きっと役立つはずだ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_026"
msgid "Damn it. My office... If they get access...\n"
msgstr "しまった。私のオフィスの…。もしあれがヤツらの手に…。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_027"
msgid "Get there first, Jo, and destroy the files.\n"
msgstr "すぐに行ってファイルを破壊してくれ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_028"
msgid "Things are desperate. They've planted a bomb.\n"
msgstr "大変なことになったぞ、ヤツらが爆弾をしかけたようだ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_029"
msgid "Find it and get it out of the building.\n"
msgstr "すぐに見つけて、ビルの外にだすんだ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_030"
msgid "Access denied - authorization failure.\n"
msgstr "アクセスを許可されていません。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_031"
msgid "Emergency overrides have been engaged.\n"
msgstr "非常用手動スイッチが起動された\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_032"
msgid "Well done, Joanna. We're nearly clear...\n"
msgstr "よくやったジョアンナ！　こっちもほぼ完了だ…。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_033"
msgid "The last dropship is waiting for you. Hurry.\n"
msgstr "最後のシャトルが君を待っている。急ぐんだ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_034"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な装置が破壊された\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_035"
msgid "The autodefenses will really help me out.\n"
msgstr "そう、自動機銃に助けてもらわなきゃ…。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_036"
msgid "So this is what Foster was working on.\n"
msgstr "これがフォスターが試作していたヤツね。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_037"
msgid ""
"I'll have to go carefully... The hostages are \n"
"counting on me.\n"
msgstr ""
"気をつけないと…。\n"
"みんなの命が私にかかっているわ。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_038"
msgid ""
"Well, at least I won't know if I'm doing \n"
"anything wrong.\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_039"
msgid "The bomb has been detonated...\n"
msgstr "爆弾が爆発してしまった…\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_040"
msgid "You have been given a Devastator.\n"
msgstr "デバスターを手に入れた\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_041"
msgid ""
"All ready, Joanna? We can't keep the Maian delegation waiting. Or the "
"President, of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"準備はいいか、ジョアンナ？　マイアンの\n"
"代表や大統領を待たせるわけにはいかん。\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_042"
msgid ""
"Am I ready? What do you mean? I was ready half an hour ago. It was you "
"holding us up!\n"
msgstr ""
"エ～？　３０分前からここにいるわ！\n"
"待たせているのは、ボスの方でしょ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_043"
msgid ""
"But you know how it is, Joanna... I had to make sure my hair was just right,"
" and then there was the suit...\n"
msgstr ""
"でもジョアンナ、ヘアスタイルも\n"
"キメないと…、このスーツも…\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_044"
msgid "They should keep you away from mirrors. Nervous?\n"
msgstr ""
"アッチには、ルームミラーがないと\n"
"いいのにね。　ドキドキします？\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_045"
msgid ""
"Very. I've waited for this moment for so many years. Contact, friendly "
"contact, between Humans and Maians is what the Institute was founded for. "
"And in a few minutes we'll be at the White House, and it will finally "
"happen...\n"
msgstr ""
"あぁ。私は長年、今日のこの日を\n"
"ずっと待っていたのだ。\n"
"pマイアンと人類とのフレンドリーな出会い。\n"
"pもうすぐホワイトハウスで\n"
"それが現実のものとなる…\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_046"
msgid "Where did that come from?\n"
msgstr "何の音だ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_047"
msgid "It was up on ground level...\n"
msgstr "玄関だわ…\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_048"
msgid ""
"Looks like someone doesn't know when to quit. We've got to get everyone "
"out!\n"
msgstr ""
"しつこいヤツらね。\n"
"スタッフを助けなきゃ！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_049"
msgid "Get clear! I'll hold them off... You can come back and get me later!\n"
msgstr ""
"早く出発して！\n"
"私はアトでいいから！\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_050"
msgid "At least, I hope you can.\n"
msgstr "みんな、無事でね…\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_051"
msgid "You need the Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "データリンカが必要です\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_052"
msgid "Connection has been made.\n"
msgstr "接続完了\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_053"
msgid "Bypassing security systems.\n"
msgstr "セキュリティシステムにアクセス中\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_054"
msgid "Virus has been downloaded successfully.\n"
msgstr "コンピュータウイルスのインストール成功\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_055"
msgid "Ship's engines have been activated.\n"
msgstr "飛行機のエンジン始動\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_056"
msgid "Connection to ship has been broken.\n"
msgstr "データリンカの接続が切れました\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_057"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_058"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_059"
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "データリンカ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_060"
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "データリンカ\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_061"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "データリンカを手に入れた\n"
